      },
      "text": "Mature:       Precipitation initiates (Bergeron or coalescence)\n              Downdraft develops (evaporative cooling + precip drag)\n              Both updraft and downdraft coexist\n              MOST LIGHTNING, heaviest rain, possible hail"
    },
    {
