      },
      "text": "```\n1. AMBIENT VORTEX TUBES (horizontal rotation from wind shear):\n   Wind shear creates horizontal \"rolling\" tubes of air"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-SEVERE-WEATHER.md#020",
      "path": [
