        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Severe Weather - Supercells, Tornadoes, Tropical Cyclones",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "2. TILTING:\n   Thunderstorm updraft tilts horizontal vorticity into vertical\n   (horizontal rolling → vertical spinning = mesocyclone)"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-SEVERE-WEATHER.md#021",
      "path": [
        "06-SEVERE-WEATHER.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
