        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Severe Weather - Supercells, Tornadoes, Tropical Cyclones",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "3. STRETCHING:\n   Updraft intensifies and stretches the vortex tube vertically\n   → Vorticity amplifies (conservation of angular momentum)\n   → Mesocyclone intensifies\n```"
    },
    {
