        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Annual US tornadoes:** ~1,200 average; peak April–June in Tornado Alley (TX/OK/KS/NE) and Dixie Alley (MS/AL/TN). The EF0–EF1 constitute ~80% of all tornadoes; EF4–EF5 are ~1% but cause majority of fatalities."
    },
