        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Severe Weather - Supercells, Tornadoes, Tropical Cyclones",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Tornado outbreak** — multiple tornadoes in a short period from one weather system. Super outbreak April 25–28, 2011: 360 tornadoes in 4 days, 324 deaths."
    },
