        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Severe Weather - Supercells, Tornadoes, Tropical Cyclones",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "BOW ECHO:\n  Leading line bows forward due to strong rear-inflow jet\n     →→→\n    / bow\\\n   /      \\\n  bookend  bookend\n  vortex   vortex\n   (cyclonic at N end → can produce brief tornadoes)\n```"
    },
